  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</a> </span>will shortly announce the <strong data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"231\">result</strong> for the <strong data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"258\">MTS / Havaldar</strong> posts after evaluating candidates’ <strong data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"328\">performance in the examination</strong>. This recruitment was conducted for <strong data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"380\">7,948 posts</strong>. Applications for the <strong data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"442\">SSC MTS / Havaldar Recruitment 2025</strong> were accepted from <strong data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"494\">26 June 2025 to 24 July 2025</strong>. The <strong data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"515\">examination</strong> was held from <strong data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"550\">04 February 2026</strong>. Candidates are advised to regularly check the <strong data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"623\"> portal</strong> for updates regarding the <strong data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"684\">SSC MTS / Havaldar Result 2026</strong>, which will be uploaded shortly.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">SSC MTS / Havaldar Result 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>26 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>24 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>25 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Online Correction Date : <strong>04-06 August 2025&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Self-Slot Booking Start&nbsp;<strong>: From 15 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Start&nbsp;<strong>: From 04 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Self Slot Booking : <strong>16-25 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Application Status : <strong>28 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Details : <strong>30 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card :<em><strong>&nbsp;</strong></em><strong>02 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>03 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result : <strong>Available Soon</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General, EWS, OBC <strong>: Rs. 100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST <strong>: 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All Category Female <strong>: 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC Multi Tasking Staff MTS Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 August 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>27 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per SSC Multi Tasking Staff MTS Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC Multi Tasking Staff MTS 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 7,948 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Multi Tasking Staff (MTS)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">6810</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Havaldar</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1138</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>SSC Multi Tasking Staff MTS Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9918%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0082%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9918%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Multi Tasking Staff (MTS)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0082%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have passed their 10 Level (Matriculation Level) of Examination from any recognized board will be considered for this recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 31.9918%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Havaldar</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.0082%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates who have passed their 10 Level (Matriculation Level) of Examination from any recognized board will be considered for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Height :</strong>&nbsp;157.5 Cms (Male); 152 Cms (Female)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Chest :</strong>&nbsp;76 – 81 Cms (Male)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Cycling :</strong>&nbsp;8 Km in 30 Min (Male); 3 Km in 25 Min (Female)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Weight (For Female Only) :</strong>&nbsp;Minimum 48Kg</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Walking :</strong>&nbsp;1600 meter in 15 Min (Male); 1 Km in 20 Min (Female)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download SSC MTS / Havaldar Result 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Open on the region wise&nbsp;<strong>Download Result</strong>&nbsp;link from the&nbsp;<strong>Important Links&nbsp;</strong>box placed below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page, candidates have to fill up the&nbsp; required fields given as following:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Registration ID/ Roll Number/ Name</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Father’s Name (In case of searching by name)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">And Click on&nbsp;<strong>Search</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After submitting the correct details, applicants will be able to download the Result.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC Multi Tasking Staff MTS Recruitment 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CBT Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">PET / PST (For Havaldar)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Register For Result</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\